      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hi this is according to the definitions in \nhttps://docs.partner.android.com/gms/building/integrating/build-image?hl\u003den\nUnfortunately there does not seem to be a clear definition publicly on developer.android.com.\n\nro.boot.hardware.sku is for product partition\n\nro.boot.product.hardware.sku is for the odm partition.\n\nI agree that the naming is a bit confusing.\n\n\nOne alternative might be to instead check:\nBuild.SKU\nhttps://developer.android.com/reference/android/os/Build#SKU\n\n\n\nThen SKU_PROPERTY could be replaced by Build.ODM_SKU \n\nIf build properties are used, when need to check against Build.UNKNOWN instead of empty string.\n\n\nThere does not seem to be a corresponding BUILD value for \"ro.boot.product.vendor.sku\"",
